  "description": "IZATIO crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group I -4 3 d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H60 Gd3 N30 Ni3 O23 1+,10.75(C1 H4 O1),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 0 O neighbors; Gd1G (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1G (Ni) has 0 O neighbors; Gd1J (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1J (Ni) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.866-3.866 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.47-110.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64.75H103Gd3Ni3N31O36.75.",
